# viba.repomix — a directory of viba code, as one Markdown document (viba-repomix.md)
#
# The document is the one viba/markdown.py reads: a section per file, its name
# the file's path in the directory, its first code block the file's code. A
# .viba file's leading and trailing comments become that section's prose.

VibaRepoMix =
    (str * { markdown file content })
  <- $viba_code_dir (str * { directory containing viba code })
